MATRIX: Pascal's triangle by recursive combination. Rows 0 through 8.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE fact WITH n
  IF n IS LESS THAN 2 THEN
    CASH OUT 1
  PERIOD
  CASH OUT n TIMES CALL fact WITH n MINUS 1
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE choose WITH n AND k
  IF k IS GREATER THAN n THEN
    CASH OUT 0
  PERIOD
  IF k IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
    CASH OUT 1
  PERIOD
  CASH OUT CALL floor WITH (CALL fact WITH n) DIVIDED BY ((CALL fact WITH k) TIMES (CALL fact WITH (n MINUS k)))
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI row EQUALS 0
GRIND WHILE row IS LESS THAN 9
  BUGATTI col EQUALS 0
  BUGATTI line EQUALS ""
  GRIND WHILE col IS LESS THAN row PLUS 1
    BUGATTI line EQUALS line PLUS (CALL choose WITH row AND col) PLUS " "
    BUGATTI col EQUALS col PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI line
  BUGATTI row EQUALS row PLUS 1
STOP GRINDING

WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI "C(8, 3) = " PLUS CALL choose WITH 8 AND 3

BACK TO THE MATRIX
